<style>
 #fb-{{ section.id }} { background: #fff; }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .hero { display: flex; flex-direction: row; gap: clamp(28px,5vw,64px); align-items: center; padding-top: clamp(40px,5vw,72px); }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .photo { flex: 0 0 clamp(280px,34%,420px); }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .photo img { width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 16px; display: block; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .hero .copy { flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} h1 { font-size: clamp(34px,4.4vw,52px); line-height: 1.06; margin: 14px 0 14px; }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .cred-line { color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .bio { max-width: 70ch; margin: clamp(36px,4vw,56px) 0 0; }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .bio p { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink-2); margin: 0 0 18px; }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .callout { border-left: 3px solid var(--gold); padding: 4px 0 4px 20px; }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .callout a { color: var(--blue); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .creds { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); gap: 24px; margin: clamp(40px,5vw,64px) 0; padding: clamp(28px,3vw,40px) 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .creds .eyebrow { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold-deep); }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .creds h3 { font-size: 18px; margin: 8px 0 6px; }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .creds p { margin: 0; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .block { padding: clamp(28px,3vw,40px) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .block .ip6-eyebrow { display:block; margin-bottom: 10px; }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .block h2 { font-size: clamp(24px,2.8vw,32px); }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .block .lead { color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 17px; margin: 10px 0 18px; }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 20px; display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; max-width: 560px; }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .card svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; color: var(--gold-deep); flex: none; margin-top: 1px; }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .card .t { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); font-size: 15px; }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .card .s { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13.5px; margin-top: 2px; }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .quote { text-align: center; padding: clamp(48px,6vw,88px) 0 clamp(8px,2vw,24px); }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .quote p { font-family: var(--serif); font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(24px,3.2vw,38px); line-height: 1.22; color: var(--ink); max-width: 22ch; margin: 0 auto 28px; }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .quote .acts { display: flex; gap: 18px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
 @media (max-width: 860px) {
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .hero { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .photo { flex: none; max-width: 320px; }
 #fb-{{ section.id }} .creds { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px 18px; }
 }
 @media (max-width: 520px){ #fb-{{ section.id }} .creds { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
<section id="fb-{{ section.id }}" class="ip6 ip6-bright ip6-reveal">
 <div class="ip6-wrap">
 <div class="hero ip6-rise d1">
 <div class="photo"><img src="{{ 'ip6-founder.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Prof. AbulKalam M. Shamsuddin, MD, PhD — founder and formulator of IP6 Original" width="420" height="520" loading="lazy"></div>
 <div class="copy">
 <span class="ip6-eyebrow">The Founder</span>
 <h1>The scientist behind IP6 Original.</h1>
 <p class="cred-line">Prof. AbulKalam M. Shamsuddin, MD, PhD · Physician-scientist · University of Maryland School of Medicine · Founder, IP-6 Research, Inc.</p>
 </div>
 </div>

 <div class="bio ip6-rise d2">
 <p>Professor AbulKalam M. Shamsuddin, MD, PhD is a physician-scientist who has spent his career at the University of Maryland School of Medicine researching the health properties of inositol hexaphosphate, and a pioneer of the published research on the molecule. He founded IP-6 Research, Inc. in Baltimore, Maryland to bring the product of that research directly to consumers. IP6 Original is his formulation.</p>
 <p class="callout">Dr. Shamsuddin is also the founding president of the IP-6 Research Foundation, the non-profit that continues to support peer-reviewed investigation into inositol hexaphosphate. <a href="https://ip-6.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit the IP-6 Research Foundation →</a></p>
 </div>

 <div class="creds ip6-rise d2">
 <div><div class="eyebrow">Physician-Scientist</div><p>University of Maryland School of Medicine</p></div>
 <div><div class="eyebrow">Pioneer in IP6 Research</div><p>A body of published, peer-reviewed work</p></div>
 <div><div class="eyebrow">Founder</div><p>IP-6 Research, Inc., Baltimore, MD</p></div>
 <div><div class="eyebrow">Formulator</div><p>Formulated IP6 Original himself</p></div>
 </div>

 <div class="quote ip6-rise d4">
 <p class="serif">&ldquo;IP6 Original is the supplement built to the specification his own research describes.&rdquo;</p>
 <div class="acts">
 <a class="ip6-btn ip6-btn--primary" href="/products/ip-6-original">Shop IP6 Original</a>
 <a class="ip6-textlink" href="/pages/story">Read the full story →</a>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
</section>
{% schema %}
{ "name": "IP6 Founder Bio", "tag": "section", "settings": [], "presets": [{ "name": "IP6 Founder Bio" }] }
{% endschema %}
